  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The forward march of time is as familiar to you as your heartbeat. You know and are always under the effects of the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.BvNbDwFYaidKJG9j]{Time Sense}  cantrip unless you choose not to be. You can benefit from its status bonus on any single check you make as a free action, not just on the turn you cast the spell. As normal per the spell, once you gain the bonus, you cannot gain it again for 1 hour.</p>"
